    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODULAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect. Upgrade. Survive. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>MODULAR</strong>, a 2D sci-fi adventure where you begin with a single core module and forge your own path through a danger. Find and connect new modules to expand your capabilities\u2014whether it's weapons, shields, engines, or research labs. Your &quot;MODULAR&quot; is what you make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange worlds, uncover new technologies, and adapt to survive against hostile environments. Each decision shapes your journey. Will you focus on exploration, engineering, or combat? The power is in your hands \u2014 literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Attach and combine different ship modules to build your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Progression</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Unlock new tech, abilities, and upgrades as you go. (we are always adding more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Sci-Fi World</strong> \u2013 Mysterious environments, modules, and strange phenomena await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat</strong> \u2013 Strategic battles with reactive enemies that adapt to your build. (super scary)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Visuals &amp; Sound</strong> \u2013 A minimalist yet immersive aesthetic paired with a dynamic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULAR is about <strong>freedom, creativity, and survival</strong> in a universe that doesn\u2019t wait for anyone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODULAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect. Upgrade. Survive. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>MODULAR</strong>, a 2D sci-fi adventure where you begin with a single core module and forge your own path through a danger. Find and connect new modules to expand your capabilities\u2014whether it's weapons, shields, engines, or research labs. Your &quot;MODULAR&quot; is what you make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange worlds, uncover new technologies, and adapt to survive against hostile environments. Each decision shapes your journey. Will you focus on exploration, engineering, or combat? The power is in your hands \u2014 literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Attach and combine different ship modules to build your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Progression</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Unlock new tech, abilities, and upgrades as you go. (we are always adding more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Sci-Fi World</strong> \u2013 Mysterious environments, modules, and strange phenomena await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat</strong> \u2013 Strategic battles with reactive enemies that adapt to your build. (super scary)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Visuals &amp; Sound</strong> \u2013 A minimalist yet immersive aesthetic paired with a dynamic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULAR is about <strong>freedom, creativity, and survival</strong> in a universe that doesn\u2019t wait for anyone.</p>",
    "short_description": "MODULAR is a 2D sci-fi adventure where you build your &quot;MODULAR&quot; from modules. Explore, survive, and adapt as you uncover new tech, battle threats, and shape your journey through a dynamic environment.Your MODULAR. Your strategy. Your story.",
